Title: The Biscuit Tin
Credit: A school musical by
Author: Lexington's examples

# ACT ONE

.SCENE 1 - THE SCHOOL KITCHEN, MORNING

The CHILDREN of class 4B stand around an empty biscuit tin. ANNA steps forward.

ANNA
(to the audience)
Every morning it is full, and by break time it is empty. Nobody knows why.

The music of WHO TOOK THE BISCUIT begins.

> 3. WHO TOOK THE BISCUIT <

ANNA
~SOMEBODY CAME IN THE NIGHT,
~SOMEBODY OPENED THE TIN.

ALL
~WHO? WHO? WHO TOOK THE BISCUIT?

Dance break: the CHILDREN search under the tables.

> 3A. WHO TOOK THE BISCUIT - PLAYOFF <

> BLACKOUT.
